name hypdvips
category Package
revision 53197
shortdesc Hyperref extensions for use with dvips
longdesc The hypdvips package fixes some problems when using hyperref
longdesc with dvips. It also adds support for breaking links, file
longdesc attachments, embedded documents and different types of
longdesc GoTo-links. The cooperation of hyperref with cleveref is
longdesc improved, which in addition allows an enhanced back-referencing
longdesc system.
